o2 = FirstPackage::firstFunction -- a silly first function
     *****************************************************

       * Usage: 
             firstFunction n
       * Inputs:
           * n, an "integer", 
       * Outputs:
           * a "string", a silly string, depending on the value of n

     Here we show an example.

     +------------------------+
     |  i1 : firstFunction 1  |
     |                        |
     |  o1 = Hello World!     |
     +------------------------+
     |  i2 : firstFunction 0  |
     |                        |
     |  o2 = D'oh!            |
     +------------------------+
